[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3706177209","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114110#issuecomment-3706177209","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114110","id":3706177209,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7c58a5","user":{"login":"ej-sanmartin","id":29460583,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NDYwNTgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29460583?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin","html_url":"https://github.com/ej-sanmartin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-02T20:29:28Z","updated_at":"2026-01-02T20:29:28Z","body":"I checked this and this seems suspicous to me, in `module/gltf/gltf_document.cpp:4161`:\n\n```cpp\n// We ignore the Godot Engine node that is the skeleton.\n```\n\nI can confirm in code in the export path `Skeleton3D` is dropped when exporting to `glTF`.\n\nAnd I'd imagine these animation calculations for root bones are in skeleton-local space and thus expect the skeleton Godot node in order to be properly animated.\n\nWe should ensure `Skeleton3D` is converted to a `glTF` node and all relevant root bones children of that node.\n\nI'm curious, though, it looks like @fire made this change (the comment about ignoring the skeleton) at 4b4efd26740d4912e66bf8503e8f146ed2be33b7 and i'm wondering why the skeleton node was ignored in the first place and what they think.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3706177209/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3706528705","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114110#issuecomment-3706528705","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114110","id":3706528705,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7c7SPB","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-03T00:26:55Z","updated_at":"2026-01-03T00:42:39Z","body":"Does it fix the export if we restore the skeleton?\n\nIt was also one my earlier major pull requests and was done during my break so I don't remember the reasoning for something 5 years ago.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/co